 task('al-f15',4,L('Halve or subtract one'),L('Start with a positive whole number. If it is even, halve it; if it is odd, subtract 1. Each halving or subtraction is one step. Repeat until the number is 1. How many steps does it take starting from 20? Starting from 31?'),[n('twenty',L('Steps from 20 to 1'),5),n('thirtyOne',L('Steps from 31 to 1'),8)],explain,L('From 20: 10, 5, 4, 2, 1 is 5 steps. From 31: 30, 15, 14, 7, 6, 3, 2, 1 is 8 steps. Odd numbers cost an extra step, so 31 takes longer than 20 even though it is not much larger.'),L('Which number from 1 to 31 takes the most steps? Why?'))
